  "refData": {
    "title": "B2bizz - B2B Consulting Agency for Digital Growth",
    "totalHeight": 5343,
    "sections": [
      {
        "idx": 0,
        "tag": "SECTION",
        "heading": "Get to know B2bizz B2B consulting",
        "height": 1088,
        "paddingTop": "10px",
        "paddingBottom": "0px",
        "fullText": "Get to know B2bizz B2B consulting\n\nWe’re your long-term growth partners. Discover who we are and how we help B2B companies unlock their full potential.\n\nExplore our services\n\nExpertise across key sectors\n\nHealthcare   /   Financial services   /   Technology   /   Manufacturing   /   Logistics   /   Retail",
        "images": [
          {
            "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/j1u7mOstGtDSOqkHWRDDUZrUo4.png?width=692&height=722",
            "alt": "About Decoration",
            "w": 340,
            "h": 355
          },
          {
            "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/qyFALiDAT11qq2R9yTbABUg1qo.jpg?width=800&height=800",
            "alt": "Hero BG ",
