      {
        "idx": 2,
        "tag": "SECTION",
        "heading": "Principles that shape our strategy",
        "height": 589,
        "paddingTop": "0px",
        "paddingBottom": "150px",
        "fullText": "Principles that shape our strategy\n\nAt the heart of our consulting practice lies a set of core values that guide how we think, work, and lead.\n\nIntegrity first\n\nWe operate with honesty and transparency.\n\nClient-Centric\n\nYour success is our priority.\n\nStrategic thinking\n\nEvery decision is backed by data and insights.\n\nCollaboration\n\nWe believe in working together, not just consulting.\n\nInnovation\n\nWe challenge norms to find smarter solutions.",
        "images": []
      },
