        "heading": "Our vision",
        "height": 502,
        "paddingTop": "0px",
        "paddingBottom": "150px",
        "fullText": "Our vision\n\nElectrical service costs vary depending on the job's complexity, your location, and the electrician’s experience.\n\nGlobal partnerships\n\nStrategic execution\n\nDigital leadership\n\nClient empowerment\n\nPeople-First culture\n\nOur mission",
